        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>LCN 2030 Series Door Closer Arm</b>\r\n<p>This is a replacement Arm for <a href=\"/products/lcn-model-2030-series-store-front-concealed-door-closer\"><b>LCN 2030 Series</b></a> (LCN Pacer) Concealed Door Closer.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>Also available other <a href=\"/search?type=product&q=LCN Door Closer Parts\"><b>LCN Door Closer Parts</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>This door closer Arm is Handed. Package includes the #10-32 set screw. Aluminum finish.\r\n</p>\r\n<p><b>*Sold Individually</b></p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Important</b> When selecting <b>Door Hand</b> for this door closer arm:  \r\n<br>\r\n1. Stand on the <b>Push Side</b> of the door, facing the door. <br>\r\n2. If the \"Pivot Hinge\" is on your \"Right\", choose \"Right Hand Door\". <br>\r\n3. If the \"Pivot Hinge\" is on your \"Left\", choose \"Left Hand Door\". <br>\r\n\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/closer-handing.gif?v=1704354510\"  width=\"410\" height=\"195\" border=\"0\"alt=\"door closer handing\">\r\n</p>",
